{
  "declined": "none",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "taskResponse",
      "score": 6.0,
      "reason": "作者回應題目，提出同意與不同意的觀點（\"I partly agree with this opinion\"）並給出例子與建議，因此任務回應是充分但缺乏更深入發展與更強的支持細節。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coherence",
      "score": 6.0,
      "reason": "文章結構清楚，有引言、正文段與結論，句與段之間有基本連貫（例如：\"Firstly... However... In addition...\"），但段內發展有時不夠一致且過渡較簡單。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lexical",
      "score": 6.0,
      "reason": "詞彙基本能表達意思（如 \"pollution\", \"souvenir\", \"protect environment\"），但用詞重複（\"bring\" 多次）且部分搭配或詞形使用不當（如 \"tourism bring\"，\"local people life\"）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "grammarRange",
      "score": 5.5,
      "reason": "句子結構多為簡單句且有多處文法與搭配錯誤（例如 \"go to other country\", \"tourism also bring\", \"these people maybe will not have job\"），限制了語法範圍與準確性。"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "quote": "tourism bring more problems than benefits",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "主詞與動詞之間缺少第三人稱單數-s，正確應為 \"tourism brings\"。",
      "suggestion": "tourism brings more problems than benefits"
    },
    {
      "quote": "go to other country",
      "type": "preposition",
      "why": "缺少冠詞或正確複數形式，英語中應說 \"go to another country\" 或 \"go to other countries\"。",
      "suggestion": "go to another country"
    },
    {
      "quote": "these people maybe will not have job",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "語序與冠詞錯誤，且 'maybe' 與助動詞不當地一起使用，應改為更自然的表達。",
      "suggestion": "these people might not have a job"
    }
  ],
  "more": [
    {
      "quote": "tourists come, they need to live in hotel",
      "type": "article",
      "why": "名詞前需要不定冠詞，應為 \"live in a hotel\"。",
      "suggestion": "live in a hotel"
    },
    {
      "quote": "buy souvenir",
      "type": "article",
      "why": "可數名詞需冠詞或複數，應為 \"buy souvenirs\" 或 \"buy a souvenir\"。",
      "suggestion": "buy souvenirs"
    },
    {
      "quote": "tourism also bring many problems",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "動詞形式錯誤，需第三人稱單數-s：\"brings\"。",
      "suggestion": "tourism also brings many problems"
    },
    {
      "quote": "the place become dirty",
      "type": "verb",
      "why": "動詞時態或形式不正確，應為 \"becomes\"（第三人稱單數）。",
      "suggestion": "the place becomes dirty"
    },
    {
      "quote": "local people life become not convenient",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "名詞用法與形容詞搭配不自然，應用合適的名詞片語如 \"local people's lives become inconvenient\"。",
      "suggestion": "local people's lives become inconvenient"
    }
  ],
  "strengths": [
    {
      "quote": "Firstly, tourism can bring a lot of money to local community.",
      "why": "句子清楚點出一個正面觀點，並在後面用例子（Jiufen）支持，展示論點與例證的連接。"
    },
    {
      "quote": "In conclusion, I partly agree that tourism bring problems, but I think if we control it well, it is still good for local community.",
      "why": "結論回應開頭觀點並提出解決方法，結構完整且立場明確。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "你的作文結構清晰，有引言、分段論述與結論，並使用了實例（Jiufen）來支持觀點。接下來請注意動詞與名詞的單複數與冠詞使用（例如 \"brings\", \"a hotel\", \"souvenirs\"），以及改善句子連接與更精確的詞彙搭配，這會顯著提升寫作品質。"
}
